 mission-driven comprehensive college located in Boston’s Back Bay, serving a diverse group of students. Fisher is small but mighty, with great benefits, competitive salaries and a collegial workplace. Current openings Fisher College is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against candidates on the basis of race, ethnicity, religion, sex, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability status, or veteran status. Women, people of color, LGBTQ individuals, and members of other minority or marginalized groups are strongly encouraged to apply. Campus 118 Beacon Street Boston MA 02116 617.236.8800 Connect with Us Facebook (opens in new window/tab) Instagram (opens in new window/tab) TikTok (opens in new window/tab) YouTube (opens in new window/tab) X Fisher College Apply (opens in new window/tab) Quick Links Work with Us Athletics Corporate Partnerships News FAQs Order Transcripts Contact Us Notices and Disclosures Fisher College admits students of any race, color, national and ethnic origin to all the rights, privileges, programs, and activities generally accorded or made available to students at CCES. CCES does not discriminate on the basis of sex, race, color, national or ethnic origin, creed, religion, or sexual orientation in the administration of its educational policies, admission policies, financial aid, scholarship or other programs, or athletic or other school-administered programs and activities. © Copyright 2001-2026, Fisher College. All rights reserved Site Map Privacy Policy Notices & Disclosures Consent Preferences Powered by Finalsite"
